WEBVTT

00:00:48.026 --> 00:00:49.219
What is this?

00:00:49.405 --> 00:00:50.688
Am I getting jealous?

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:51.888
This can't be, Carmela!

00:00:52.264 --> 00:00:53.515
Erase, erase.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:54.333
By the way...

00:00:54.975 --> 00:00:56.910
Helena agreed to
go out with me.

00:00:56.935 --> 00:00:59.020
We're going to the
field of roses.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.565
Do you want to come?

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:02.457
No, thanks.

00:01:02.482 --> 00:01:04.109
I have lots of things
to do at home.

00:01:05.006 --> 00:01:06.294
Good luck to the two of you.

00:01:06.319 --> 00:01:07.282
Good luck.

00:01:07.946 --> 00:01:08.672
Good luck.

00:01:08.697 --> 00:01:10.282
Please accept my heart

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:12.200
that only belongs to you.

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:14.347
Oh, Juanito. Since we're already here...

00:01:15.328 --> 00:01:16.454
Why don't you sing a song

00:01:16.479 --> 00:01:17.689
to Miss Helena as well?

00:01:17.714 --> 00:01:18.953
Carmelita,

00:01:19.749 --> 00:01:21.459
Explain yourself to me.

00:01:21.585 --> 00:01:24.004
Juanito and I have decided

00:01:24.421 --> 00:01:25.881
to do something

00:01:25.906 --> 00:01:27.173
to stop the wedding.

00:01:27.841 --> 00:01:30.552
I am still in love with Leandro.

00:01:30.803 --> 00:01:34.489
Carmela, why are you smiling?

00:01:34.514 --> 00:01:35.682
Are you looking for this?

00:01:35.682 --> 00:01:36.808
My love,

00:01:35.682 --> 00:01:36.808
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:01:36.808 --> 00:01:38.226
I am hoping we can

00:01:38.226 --> 00:01:39.311
rekindle our relationship.

00:01:39.477 --> 00:01:41.813
And if you and Juanito succeed

00:01:41.813 --> 00:01:43.607
in stopping the wedding...

00:01:43.607 --> 00:01:45.901
I hope you open up your heart again...

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:47.235
for Leandro.

00:03:50.734 --> 00:03:53.737
I hope you open up your heart again

00:03:54.112 --> 00:03:56.239
for Leandro.

00:04:17.699 --> 00:04:20.472
I will not give up on you, my love.

00:04:21.097 --> 00:04:24.100
I am hoping that you
will give me a chance.

00:04:25.101 --> 00:04:26.519
Is this a song or a poem?

00:04:27.228 --> 00:04:28.371
Gosh!

00:04:28.396 --> 00:04:29.564
It's already midnight

00:04:29.981 --> 00:04:31.649
but he's still bugging me.

00:04:33.985 --> 00:04:34.944
Miss...

00:04:35.987 --> 00:04:38.406
There's something I want to give you.

00:04:42.869 --> 00:04:45.246
I did not forget

00:04:46.289 --> 00:04:50.188
your strict instruction
since Mr. Leandro left.

00:04:51.461 --> 00:04:54.547
You asked me to dispose of all his letters.

00:04:54.547 --> 00:04:56.341
Even those that are to be delivered.

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:01.429
I apologize, Miss,

00:05:01.429 --> 00:05:03.556
but I didn't throw all of it.

00:05:03.556 --> 00:05:07.477
I thought there would come a time

00:05:07.477 --> 00:05:10.355
when you would need to read his letters.

00:05:10.355 --> 00:05:12.482
So that you may have a better decision.

00:05:26.913 --> 00:05:28.498
Miss,

00:05:28.498 --> 00:05:30.375
it's not yet too late.

00:05:30.875 --> 00:05:34.045
It seems like Mr. Leandro
doesn't plan to give up.

00:05:34.045 --> 00:05:37.173
I hope you won't give up as easily.

00:05:46.891 --> 00:05:50.616
If Leandro didn't write
what his fault was,

00:05:50.804 --> 00:05:52.056
I don't know what I'll do.

00:05:52.814 --> 00:05:54.732
I think I'll be reading
throughout the night.

00:05:56.776 --> 00:05:59.863
17th of January,

00:05:59.863 --> 00:06:03.700
Year 1891.

00:06:04.492 --> 00:06:05.702
My dear Carmelita.

00:06:06.202 --> 00:06:06.995
How are you?

00:06:08.037 --> 00:06:11.374
Have you read the letters I've sent you?

00:06:12.208 --> 00:06:15.795
You might still be mad at me.

00:06:16.921 --> 00:06:18.381
I cannot blame you.

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:20.758
I want you to understand that

00:06:21.301 --> 00:06:23.803
it is my dream to join the army.

00:06:24.596 --> 00:06:26.222
Aside from Father's wishes

00:06:26.598 --> 00:06:28.766
for me to follow in his footsteps,

00:06:28.766 --> 00:06:30.768
it is also my own desire.

00:06:51.414 --> 00:06:54.876
I'm touched by Leandro's
efforts and principles.

00:06:54.876 --> 00:06:57.253
He truly loves Carmelita.

00:06:57.879 --> 00:07:01.007
Maybe Carmelita just acted dramatically

00:07:10.325 --> 00:07:11.399
Carmelita...

00:07:13.061 --> 00:07:14.854
I hope you'll give me a chance.

00:07:16.147 --> 00:07:18.392
For me to prove how much I care for you.

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:21.881
I know it's not my place to forgive

00:07:22.028 --> 00:07:24.239
on behalf of Carmelita,

00:07:24.239 --> 00:07:27.408
but this is the only way

00:07:27.408 --> 00:07:30.203
to fulfill the mission of
stopping the wedding.

00:07:31.621 --> 00:07:32.670
Don't worry anymore.

00:07:33.331 --> 00:07:34.457
I forgive you.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:38.461
Are you saying

00:07:38.461 --> 00:07:39.837
you're not mad at me anymore?

00:07:41.756 --> 00:07:44.717
Just promise me that
you will not hurt me again.

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:49.965
Oh...

00:07:51.266 --> 00:07:52.274
Apologies.

00:07:53.268 --> 00:07:55.144
- I thought that...
- It's fine.

00:07:55.853 --> 00:07:58.273
I forgave him but that doesn't me
I get to be his girlfriend.

00:07:58.815 --> 00:07:59.965
And...

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:02.367
what if my Father and Mother catch us?

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:04.070
They'll get upset,

00:08:04.988 --> 00:08:06.098
right?

00:08:06.239 --> 00:08:07.323
Carmelita,

00:08:07.323 --> 00:08:09.200
our families are close to one another.

00:08:10.076 --> 00:08:12.620
They are fully aware of our relationship.

00:08:14.372 --> 00:08:15.415
I was about to ask your parents

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:17.040
for your hand in marriage.

00:08:17.333 --> 00:08:18.876
But you became angry with me

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:21.004
when you learned that I'm leaving.

00:08:21.629 --> 00:08:25.925
Gosh, if only Carmelita
didn't act like such a brat,

00:08:25.925 --> 00:08:28.094
Leandro and her would still be together.

00:08:28.261 --> 00:08:30.763
Juanito wouldn't be dragged into it

00:08:30.763 --> 00:08:32.890
and they wouldn't have died.

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:34.142
Most importantly,

00:08:34.142 --> 00:08:37.145
I wouldn't be transported into the past!

00:08:39.397 --> 00:08:40.732
But don't you worry.

00:08:41.274 --> 00:08:42.525
I will do everything

00:08:42.942 --> 00:08:44.694
for us to be together again.

00:08:46.279 --> 00:08:47.322
Leandro.

00:08:47.697 --> 00:08:49.782
Do you really know me that well?

00:08:51.534 --> 00:08:52.952
Of course, Carmelita.

00:08:54.162 --> 00:08:55.705
If you love a person,

00:08:55.705 --> 00:08:57.731
you know all the
important things about her.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:02.211
What's my favorite food?

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:05.606
Vegetable stew.

00:09:05.631 --> 00:09:08.968
Seriously? I don't even eat vegetables.

00:09:08.968 --> 00:09:11.346
Is Carmelita a vegetarian? Gosh...

00:09:12.179 --> 00:09:13.346
How about my hobbies?

00:09:14.807 --> 00:09:16.059
Reading books.

00:09:16.059 --> 00:09:17.185
Doing embroidery.

00:09:17.185 --> 00:09:17.894
Dance?

00:09:17.894 --> 00:09:18.978
Carinosa.

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:20.229
And Tinikling.

00:09:20.772 --> 00:09:21.866
Games?

00:09:22.023 --> 00:09:23.858
Is this a trick question, Carmelita?

00:09:23.858 --> 00:09:25.860
You don't like playing games.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:28.363
You're always cooped up in your house.

00:09:31.949 --> 00:09:32.950
What do I fear?

00:09:38.664 --> 00:09:39.874
You're afraid of losing me.

00:09:41.834 --> 00:09:45.922
So, pick-up lines are
popular even then, huh?

00:09:46.506 --> 00:09:49.050
Apologies. I was just joking.

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:53.471
You are afraid of bugs and beasts.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:11.545
General.

00:10:15.118 --> 00:10:16.369
Miss Carmelita.

00:10:17.954 --> 00:10:18.955
What are you doing here?

00:10:20.164 --> 00:10:21.124
Mr. Leandro.

00:10:23.334 --> 00:10:26.838
He's just keeping me company on my walk.

00:10:27.588 --> 00:10:28.673
Miss Carmelita,

00:10:29.424 --> 00:10:31.843
my brother Juanito wrote to me.

00:10:32.301 --> 00:10:35.430
He's asking why you are
not answering his letters.

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:36.722
Angelito,

00:10:36.722 --> 00:10:40.685
it is not right for you to
interrupt adult conversations.

00:10:41.436 --> 00:10:44.188
I was just really busy
with a lot of things,

00:10:44.188 --> 00:10:46.086
that's why I wasn't able to reply.

00:10:47.316 --> 00:10:52.196
You really do seem very busy right now.

00:10:52.196 --> 00:10:53.406
Don't take it the wrong way,

00:10:54.198 --> 00:10:56.659
but you will be in trouble

00:10:56.659 --> 00:10:59.120
if anyone puts malice on the two of you.

00:11:01.247 --> 00:11:02.259
Having said that...

00:11:02.749 --> 00:11:04.625
would you rather just walk with us instead?

00:11:06.002 --> 00:11:07.145
There's no need.

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:09.672
Our carriages will soon
come any moment now.

00:11:10.965 --> 00:11:11.983
Very well.

00:11:12.008 --> 00:11:12.967
We'll go ahead.

00:11:12.967 --> 00:11:15.379
I don't want to be late
on my journey to Manila.

00:11:45.708 --> 00:11:49.504
General Sergio doesn't know about
the plan to stop the wedding.

00:11:49.504 --> 00:11:53.257
He might tell Don Alejandro!
I'm doomed!

00:11:57.790 --> 00:12:00.752
I'll prepare your bath before we go.

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:02.892
Your family has been invited

00:12:02.892 --> 00:12:05.329
to the birthday of the
Governor General in Manila.

00:12:07.063 --> 00:12:08.564
Problem solved!

00:12:08.564 --> 00:12:11.359
I can avoid Leandro with this.

00:12:11.359 --> 00:12:13.903
And Don Alejandro would not suspect me.

00:12:14.946 --> 00:12:16.066
I'll help you.

00:12:16.447 --> 00:12:18.574
Do not bother yourself, Miss.

00:12:29.418 --> 00:12:31.087
I'm sure

00:12:31.087 --> 00:12:34.382
your Aunt Rosario will
be pleased to see you.

00:12:36.056 --> 00:12:37.186
Aunt Rosario?

00:12:38.302 --> 00:12:39.111
Yes.

00:12:39.136 --> 00:12:40.680
Your mother's sister.

00:12:41.264 --> 00:12:43.432
Her family has been invited as well.

00:12:46.143 --> 00:12:47.353
Oh my Gosh!

00:12:47.353 --> 00:12:50.898
I'll meet a relative who knows Carmelita.

00:12:50.898 --> 00:12:53.317
What if she asks me about books?

00:12:53.317 --> 00:12:56.362
Gosh! I need to do something about this!

00:13:30.452 --> 00:13:33.858
This is the first time
you'll be able to attend

00:13:33.858 --> 00:13:35.234
the Governor-General's birthday,

00:13:35.234 --> 00:13:36.694
isn't it, Carmelita?

00:13:39.989 --> 00:13:40.906
Sorry.

00:13:40.906 --> 00:13:42.950
I forgot that you don't have a voice.

00:13:44.243 --> 00:13:48.623
Shouting nonstop to lose my voice
was actually a smart strategy.

00:13:48.623 --> 00:13:50.541
Less talk, fewer mistakes.

00:14:00.551 --> 00:14:02.845
Ladies and Gentlemen!

00:14:04.138 --> 00:14:07.747
Tonight we celebrate
not only with good food,

00:14:08.513 --> 00:14:11.713
but also with good company.

00:14:12.563 --> 00:14:14.649
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

00:14:20.321 --> 00:14:22.114
Music please.

00:14:25.576 --> 00:14:27.536
Let us dance!

00:14:43.195 --> 00:14:47.984
OMG! I missed this! It's time to party!

00:14:55.731 --> 00:14:58.776
Carmelita., Dance appropriately.

00:14:58.776 --> 00:15:00.653
Oops, I forgot about that.

00:15:01.112 --> 00:15:03.364
They may have lived in a different time,

00:15:03.364 --> 00:15:06.780
and we came from different eras...

00:15:06.805 --> 00:15:08.586
one thing is for sure.

00:15:08.611 --> 00:15:12.407
From today, they're a part of my life too.

00:15:13.457 --> 00:15:18.045
Maestro, may I request
the traditional Cariñosa?

00:15:19.088 --> 00:15:22.033
We invite the couples to the center
of the dance floor.

00:15:22.508 --> 00:15:23.551
Cariñosa!

00:15:45.072 --> 00:15:46.490
Miss Carmelita?

00:15:49.577 --> 00:15:51.829
May I dance the Cariñosa with you?

00:16:02.209 --> 00:16:03.502
Focus, Carmela!

00:16:03.549 --> 00:16:06.427
You must be sharp in copying the dance.

00:16:06.427 --> 00:16:08.929
You must not get
distracted by Juanito's eyes.

00:17:02.191 --> 00:17:04.610
Juanito is really good at dancing.

00:18:41.844 --> 00:18:44.430
Thank you for letting me be with you

00:18:44.455 --> 00:18:46.541
during your favorite dance.

00:19:00.768 --> 00:19:02.269
You were wonderful,

00:19:02.269 --> 00:19:03.771
Carmelita and Juanito.

00:19:04.355 --> 00:19:07.441
I am glad to meet you, Mr. Juanito.

00:19:08.442 --> 00:19:10.586
I heard so many things about

00:19:10.611 --> 00:19:13.555
your handsome face and brilliant mind.

00:19:13.906 --> 00:19:16.488
And you are such a gentleman.

00:19:17.076 --> 00:19:18.385
That is not true.

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:20.533
Maybe the person who told you that

00:19:20.661 --> 00:19:21.900
were giving too much compliments.

00:19:22.373 --> 00:19:23.499
Mr. Juanito,

00:19:23.874 --> 00:19:27.252
are you saying that my niece

00:19:27.252 --> 00:19:28.921
over-praised you?

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:31.090
Wait,

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:34.677
I never said that Juanito is handsome,
brilliant, and a gentleman.

00:19:34.677 --> 00:19:36.178
Apologies, Juanito.

00:19:36.512 --> 00:19:41.308
Carmelita lost her voice
since we left San Alfonso.

00:19:41.878 --> 00:19:43.769
Why, what happened to your voice?

00:19:45.437 --> 00:19:47.206
Wondeful! wonderful!

00:19:47.231 --> 00:19:48.482
I am left speechless!

00:19:51.819 --> 00:19:54.415
It's unfortunate Helena
wasn't able to come.

00:19:54.613 --> 00:19:56.343
I heard she was sick.

00:19:58.659 --> 00:20:00.260
By the way, my friends,

00:20:00.285 --> 00:20:01.829
my only son has returned.

00:20:02.663 --> 00:20:04.974
Leandro cut his training short.

00:20:04.999 --> 00:20:06.083
But he is in Cavite now

00:20:06.083 --> 00:20:07.334
and would not be able to come.

00:20:08.466 --> 00:20:10.948
Why did Leandro went
home earlier that expected?

00:20:12.881 --> 00:20:15.092
An important thing was stolen from him.

00:20:16.385 --> 00:20:18.679
He has to take it back
before it's too late.

00:20:35.362 --> 00:20:36.947
Is that Juanito?

00:20:36.947 --> 00:20:39.074
What is he doing here in Laguna?

00:20:39.074 --> 00:20:40.951
Doesn't he have classes?

00:20:40.951 --> 00:20:41.969
Carmelita,

00:20:41.994 --> 00:20:43.412
what's happening to you?

00:20:43.954 --> 00:20:46.165
You look like you've seen a ghost.

00:20:46.582 --> 00:20:47.833
I think I saw Juanito.

00:20:47.833 --> 00:20:48.959
Can I catch up to him?

00:20:59.613 --> 00:21:00.736
Miss Carmelita.

00:21:02.014 --> 00:21:03.123
What are you doing here?

00:21:03.807 --> 00:21:05.684
Who are those candles for?

00:21:07.362 --> 00:21:10.643
I wanted to pay my
respects to a kind family

00:21:12.191 --> 00:21:13.634
who became close to me.

00:21:15.319 --> 00:21:17.362
I heard what happened
to them just this morning.

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:23.619
There were witnesses who heard

00:21:23.619 --> 00:21:25.037
their screams a few nights ago.

00:21:25.788 --> 00:21:28.325
Their whole family was brutally murdered.

00:21:29.625 --> 00:21:31.126
And their corpses were thrown

00:21:31.126 --> 00:21:32.544
in the cemetery for criminals.

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:36.381
What was their crime?

00:21:39.343 --> 00:21:40.886
They were accused of a crime

00:21:40.886 --> 00:21:42.429
I know they could never commit.

00:21:43.803 --> 00:21:47.133
It's impossible for Nestor
to steal a bag of rice.

00:21:48.268 --> 00:21:50.145
And Trinidad would never say

00:21:50.145 --> 00:21:52.022
anything false against other people.

00:21:54.691 --> 00:21:56.944
Killing their five children
was truly brutal as well.

00:21:59.188 --> 00:22:01.299
Trinidad's family was murdered?

00:22:04.667 --> 00:22:07.065
I promised Trinidad and Nestor...

00:22:09.123 --> 00:22:11.416
That I will not stop until I discover

00:22:12.292 --> 00:22:13.377
who had them murdered.

00:22:14.816 --> 00:22:19.529
It is important to recognize and address
the concerns of our workers.

00:22:20.384 --> 00:22:21.844
Dear Diary...

00:22:21.844 --> 00:22:24.221
I hope my suspicion is wrong.

00:22:24.221 --> 00:22:30.269
But I think Don Alejandro is involved
in the murder of Trinidad's family.

00:22:42.322 --> 00:22:43.824
Carmelita!

00:22:43.824 --> 00:22:46.201
We're gonna be late on
the road to San Alfonso!

00:22:46.535 --> 00:22:47.619
Where is your sister?

00:22:47.619 --> 00:22:49.288
We have to go!

00:22:56.295 --> 00:22:57.629
I won't come.

00:23:01.133 --> 00:23:02.217
What's wrong with you?

00:23:03.635 --> 00:23:04.714
What are you saying?

00:23:05.470 --> 00:23:06.972
Is there a problem, Carmelita?

00:23:08.223 --> 00:23:10.390
Why are you suddenly
acting this way, Carmelita?

00:23:13.955 --> 00:23:14.977
Doña Rosario,

00:23:15.981 --> 00:23:18.400
did something happen
while you were out last time?

00:23:19.860 --> 00:23:21.361
Nothing, Don Alejandro.

00:23:25.407 --> 00:23:27.659
My gut is always right, so
don't bother covering it up.

00:23:30.287 --> 00:23:31.872
I've learned my lesson,

00:23:32.280 --> 00:23:35.241
When i said that it was Miss Trinidad
who asked for favor

00:23:35.632 --> 00:23:37.926
Something bad happened to her family.

00:23:38.086 --> 00:23:42.925
And now, if I mention Juanito,
he might get in danger next.

00:23:45.135 --> 00:23:46.494
Answer me, Carmelita.

00:23:47.095 --> 00:23:48.148
Did something happen?

00:23:49.139 --> 00:23:52.059
How can you murder Trinidad's whole family?

00:23:53.046 --> 00:23:55.332
Carmelita, watch what you're saying.

00:23:57.093 --> 00:23:58.284
Carmelita,

00:23:59.399 --> 00:24:01.235
don't you ever talk
that way to your Father.

00:24:03.362 --> 00:24:06.031
I know that rumor is going around,

00:24:06.031 --> 00:24:08.033
but I didn't expect my own daughter...

00:24:08.033 --> 00:24:10.661
To believe in lies that were made

00:24:11.411 --> 00:24:12.913
to ruin her Father's reputation.

00:24:16.166 --> 00:24:18.752
If you don't want to be
around me, I understand.

00:24:20.324 --> 00:24:21.370
Stay here if you must.

00:24:27.118 --> 00:24:28.145
Thank you.

00:24:35.394 --> 00:24:36.447
I will go ahead.

00:24:40.607 --> 00:24:41.754
Thank you very much.

00:24:42.693 --> 00:24:43.944
God bless you.

00:24:58.208 --> 00:24:59.626
Mother Olivia!

00:25:11.221 --> 00:25:12.431
He's so vile!

00:25:16.893 --> 00:25:18.353
We can't do anything about it.

00:25:19.479 --> 00:25:20.731
If that's what's destined to happen.

00:25:23.233 --> 00:25:24.651
Let's just pray for their souls.

00:25:27.279 --> 00:25:29.072
Is that the way it's gonna be?

00:25:30.949 --> 00:25:32.492
I could've prevented

00:25:32.492 --> 00:25:34.077
a terrible thing from happening, but...

00:25:35.078 --> 00:25:36.155
But I did nothing.

00:25:54.892 --> 00:25:56.727
That isn't your mission here, dear.

00:25:59.811 --> 00:26:02.856
Focus your attention there.

00:26:05.734 --> 00:26:07.027
If you continue meddling,

00:26:08.278 --> 00:26:10.072
things will only get worse.

00:26:13.909 --> 00:26:15.042
Remember this.

00:26:16.953 --> 00:26:18.246
You are Carmelita.

00:26:21.416 --> 00:26:24.419
She will never talk back to her father.

00:26:25.670 --> 00:26:26.755
Unlike what you did.

00:26:33.929 --> 00:26:35.347
Stay here in my room

00:26:36.723 --> 00:26:38.475
until Helena gets better.

00:26:40.602 --> 00:26:43.271
Josefina will be staying in Natasha's room.

00:27:08.171 --> 00:27:09.525
I'm just wondering.

00:27:09.923 --> 00:27:12.259
If I'm here now inside Carmelita's body…

00:27:13.844 --> 00:27:15.345
Where is the real Carmelita?

00:27:32.571 --> 00:27:33.642
She's here.

00:27:35.323 --> 00:27:36.366
You're holding her in your hands.

00:27:37.367 --> 00:27:39.161
Her fate is up to you.

00:27:39.161 --> 00:27:40.412
Oh my gosh!

00:27:41.496 --> 00:27:42.914
Is Carmelita inside there?!

00:27:42.939 --> 00:27:44.107
In the diary?

00:27:59.514 --> 00:28:00.640
Do not be afraid, dear.

00:28:03.393 --> 00:28:09.232
Her mind and soul rest in this diary.

00:28:13.945 --> 00:28:15.030
She can't hurt you.

00:28:17.205 --> 00:28:21.334
Before you even came to this time…

00:28:23.295 --> 00:28:24.796
She already knew that you would come.

00:28:26.153 --> 00:28:27.237
To help her.

00:28:31.254 --> 00:28:33.071
Before Carmelita took her own life…

00:28:36.885 --> 00:28:38.261
She came to the church first.

00:28:39.679 --> 00:28:40.691
And prayed.

00:28:42.891 --> 00:28:44.601
Juanito has been dead for a week by then.

00:28:48.688 --> 00:28:50.190
I was also praying at the church too.

00:28:52.234 --> 00:28:55.445
And I heard her prayer.

00:28:57.781 --> 00:28:59.908
I followed her out of the church.

00:29:11.002 --> 00:29:12.048
Carmelita!

00:29:12.587 --> 00:29:13.612
Carmelita!

00:29:16.633 --> 00:29:18.552
If you will strike a deal with me…

00:29:20.595 --> 00:29:23.139
You may be able to change
the fate of Juanito and yourself.

00:29:28.228 --> 00:29:29.454
By rewriting the…

00:29:31.439 --> 00:29:37.487
Events that happened in
the past and changing them.

00:29:41.408 --> 00:29:43.702
I can stop Juanito's death?

00:29:46.663 --> 00:29:47.685
Not you.

00:29:49.666 --> 00:29:52.544
But a woman

00:29:52.544 --> 00:29:54.963
born into the family
of your sister, Maria.

00:29:56.006 --> 00:29:59.593
She will be born with
your striking likeness.

00:30:01.970 --> 00:30:05.932
She will rewrite your fate.

00:30:14.816 --> 00:30:18.445
Using this diary.

00:30:19.529 --> 00:30:20.852
She is the person

00:30:21.573 --> 00:30:24.784
destined to change
your fate and Juanito's.

00:30:30.040 --> 00:30:31.203
And what's the catch?

00:30:34.753 --> 00:30:35.879
You need to disappear.

00:30:37.422 --> 00:30:39.758
So that time may continue to pass.

00:30:41.801 --> 00:30:45.096
I am ready to die if that's what it takes.

00:30:48.642 --> 00:30:50.185
You aren't going to die, dear.

00:30:51.686 --> 00:31:00.278
Your soul with just
sleep inside the diary.

00:31:02.739 --> 00:31:07.698
I'd rather wait years
for the destined woman.

00:31:10.139 --> 00:31:11.777
And forget Juanito.

00:31:13.875 --> 00:31:15.105
Than letting him die.

00:31:18.004 --> 00:31:24.094
And be haunted by our
memories for the rest of my life.

00:31:25.053 --> 00:31:26.930
And my love for him.

00:31:33.520 --> 00:31:34.938
Wait, Mother Olivia.

00:31:36.356 --> 00:31:40.916
You said that if I finish my mission,

00:31:41.319 --> 00:31:43.075
Carmelita will wake up.

00:31:43.697 --> 00:31:45.450
But she won't remember anything?

00:31:46.497 --> 00:31:49.835
But what about the sacrifices
that she made for Juanito?

00:31:51.112 --> 00:31:53.675
She will just wake up
like nothing happened?

00:31:54.958 --> 00:31:56.545
She will forget about Juanito?

00:31:58.670 --> 00:32:00.588
Why do you concern yourself with it?

00:32:02.465 --> 00:32:04.300
You know the truth of Carmelita's

00:32:05.468 --> 00:32:07.929
unrequited love towards Juanito.

00:32:10.116 --> 00:32:13.369
Ouch. I forgot that this
is an unrequited love.

00:32:15.520 --> 00:32:18.440
The moment Carmelita first saw

00:32:18.440 --> 00:32:19.441
Juanito

00:32:20.191 --> 00:32:21.526
during Helena's birthday party…

00:32:23.608 --> 00:32:25.545
She immediately fell in love with him.

00:32:29.409 --> 00:32:32.120
Even though she knew
that Juanito likes Helena…

00:32:33.705 --> 00:32:35.498
Carmelita still chose to love him.

00:32:37.375 --> 00:32:38.585
OMG.

00:32:39.210 --> 00:32:43.089
Carmelita met Juanito
during Helena's party?

00:32:43.715 --> 00:32:47.302
But why did I met Juanito at UST

00:32:47.302 --> 00:32:49.345
and then we were able
to talk in the convent?

00:32:52.670 --> 00:32:54.244
I stopped you that night.

00:32:55.143 --> 00:32:56.478
But you didn't listen.

00:32:59.856 --> 00:33:02.609
That is why I don't know
how the next events will unfold.

00:33:04.652 --> 00:33:05.659
It seems like

00:33:06.404 --> 00:33:09.324
you already changed
what is supposed to happen.

00:33:15.288 --> 00:33:17.898
The one who will kill Juanito…

00:33:19.417 --> 00:33:20.504
Is it still the same person?

00:33:24.547 --> 00:33:28.134
Why didn't I read the diary
when it was first given to me?

00:33:28.134 --> 00:33:31.304
Then I would have a
clue who's behind it all.

00:33:34.974 --> 00:33:38.812
Maybe the situation has changed.

00:33:41.105 --> 00:33:44.442
But the people behind Juanito's murder…

00:33:46.945 --> 00:33:49.697
I'm sure it's still the same people.

00:33:51.135 --> 00:33:52.217
Them?

00:33:52.242 --> 00:33:53.517
So there's more than one?

00:33:56.955 --> 00:34:00.500
One cannot fulfill things
without the help of others.

00:34:03.211 --> 00:34:05.921
You know, I think Don
Alejandro is a part of this.

00:34:06.414 --> 00:34:09.556
If he can order to
murder Trinidad's family…

00:34:09.983 --> 00:34:12.595
It's not impossible for him
to murder Juanito as well.

00:34:15.682 --> 00:34:16.750
Carmela...

00:34:22.272 --> 00:34:24.357
Be careful with your assumptions.

00:34:26.782 --> 00:34:30.244
It's not enough that you
complete your mission.

00:34:33.491 --> 00:34:39.414
You must also ensure the
safety of the Montecarlos family.

00:34:40.915 --> 00:34:42.000
Especially Maria.

00:34:45.378 --> 00:34:47.380
You are from her lineage.

00:34:51.175 --> 00:34:56.055
It means that if Maria
fails to bear a child,

00:34:56.055 --> 00:35:00.101
Grandma Carmina, Mommy,
Jenny, and Emily and I

00:35:00.101 --> 00:35:02.695
will not exist in the future!

00:35:13.252 --> 00:35:16.797
I heard Carmelita went back to the convent.

00:35:18.161 --> 00:35:20.617
And that she and Don
Alejandro aren't in good terms.

00:35:24.417 --> 00:35:26.074
I may be the reason.

00:35:28.630 --> 00:35:32.278
I told her about the
murder of Trinidad's family.

00:35:35.539 --> 00:35:38.399
And she suspects that
Don Alejandro is behind it.

00:35:40.747 --> 00:35:41.809
Is it true?

00:35:44.520 --> 00:35:45.521
I can't tell for sure.

00:35:49.025 --> 00:35:50.944
But I am worried about Carmelita.

00:35:55.740 --> 00:35:57.617
Are you just worried or

00:35:59.661 --> 00:36:01.955
are you starting to have feelings for her?

00:36:08.419 --> 00:36:10.600
If you're in love with her

00:36:10.838 --> 00:36:12.627
you need to be true to yourself.

00:36:14.133 --> 00:36:15.217
And to Helena as well.

00:36:16.631 --> 00:36:18.466
That I'm sure she's in love with you.

00:36:21.766 --> 00:36:22.775
Juanito...

00:36:24.686 --> 00:36:27.230
You need to be true to who you love.

00:36:29.315 --> 00:36:30.858
But before you could do that…

00:36:32.193 --> 00:36:34.404
You need to be honest with yourself first.

00:36:35.329 --> 00:36:37.289
Honest with what you feel.

00:36:42.393 --> 00:36:45.393
You need to talk to Carmelita and Helena.

00:36:47.118 --> 00:36:49.123
And tell them the truth.

00:37:14.674 --> 00:37:17.468
Mother Olivia's revelations
were so over the top.

00:37:17.493 --> 00:37:19.841
I'm more stressed than ever.

00:37:19.866 --> 00:37:24.162
Good thing I found this
in Aunt Rosario's house.

00:38:05.620 --> 00:38:07.872
I'm not the type to get drunk easily, but

00:38:07.872 --> 00:38:10.083
this wine's no joke!

00:38:10.708 --> 00:38:12.585
I can't!

00:38:26.557 --> 00:38:27.683
Carmelita!

00:38:30.561 --> 00:38:31.896
Carmelita!

00:38:31.896 --> 00:38:32.969
Wake up!

00:38:34.077 --> 00:38:36.538
If Father and Mother learn that you drink,

00:38:36.563 --> 00:38:38.399
they will surely reprimand you!

00:38:38.820 --> 00:38:41.155
Add that to the punishment you'll get

00:38:41.155 --> 00:38:44.117
since alcohol is forbidden here.

00:38:45.701 --> 00:38:46.883
Carmelita!

00:38:47.411 --> 00:38:49.872
I never imagine you drink alcohol.

00:38:51.755 --> 00:38:53.810
What would Mr. Juanito say?

00:38:53.835 --> 00:38:56.129
That the woman he's about to marry

00:38:56.504 --> 00:38:58.506
is out of her mind alcoholic?

00:38:59.674 --> 00:39:02.593
What does Juanito have
to do about me drinking?

00:39:02.593 --> 00:39:06.389
I don't care about what he thinks of me.
He can judge me all he wants.

00:39:06.681 --> 00:39:09.684
Juanito was the one to took you back here.

00:39:09.684 --> 00:39:11.602
- What?!
- You were too drunk and…

00:39:12.395 --> 00:39:14.313
You were saying all these weird things.

00:39:15.481 --> 00:39:17.108
How did he know where I am?!

00:39:17.608 --> 00:39:19.068
He arrived here last night

00:39:19.068 --> 00:39:21.377
but Mother Olivia
refused to let him enter.

00:39:22.363 --> 00:39:23.881
That's why I helped him.

00:39:23.906 --> 00:39:26.200
I told him where he can find you.

00:39:26.200 --> 00:39:27.076
In the kitchen.

00:39:27.076 --> 00:39:28.862
There at the back, at the balcony.

00:39:28.887 --> 00:39:30.514
Why did you tell him?

00:39:30.539 --> 00:39:33.250
Because I support your marriage to him!

00:39:33.708 --> 00:39:35.585
And I didn't know you were drinking!

00:40:11.954 --> 00:40:14.123
You're so embarrasing, girl!

00:40:18.211 --> 00:40:19.324
Carmelita?

00:40:41.525 --> 00:40:42.860
What are you doing here?

00:40:46.197 --> 00:40:47.677
I want to give you something.

00:41:05.549 --> 00:41:08.135
Do you like it, Miss Carmela?

00:41:09.328 --> 00:41:12.058
How did Juanito know my real name?

00:41:15.184 --> 00:41:15.977
What is this?

00:41:17.860 --> 00:41:21.447
Do you remember the day I left San Alfonso?

00:41:21.472 --> 00:41:23.516
When I told you to meet me at the port?

00:41:24.151 --> 00:41:25.736
Because I want to give you something.

00:41:29.115 --> 00:41:30.201
Is this it?

00:41:32.076 --> 00:41:34.627
I was supposed to give you
another one at the pier.

00:41:34.954 --> 00:41:36.580
But I thought…

00:41:37.373 --> 00:41:40.594
That name suits you more
because of how naughty you are.

00:41:42.628 --> 00:41:46.465
Is he saying Carmelita
sounds fair and lovely,

00:41:46.465 --> 00:41:50.052
but Carmela sounds naughty? Crazy!

00:41:52.610 --> 00:41:54.195
What are you trying to say?

00:41:55.725 --> 00:41:56.892
Don't you remember?

00:41:58.867 --> 00:42:00.229
Remember what?

00:42:00.771 --> 00:42:01.856
Do I need to remember anything?

00:42:03.733 --> 00:42:05.526
Everything that happened to us last night.

00:42:08.591 --> 00:42:12.094
So it's true! Josefina
wasn't messing with me.

00:42:15.828 --> 00:42:17.788
I know a way to help someone remember

00:42:17.788 --> 00:42:19.582
when they've forgotten something.

00:42:22.293 --> 00:42:23.362
It's like this…

00:42:29.884 --> 00:42:32.887
On the count of three, you'll remember…

00:42:34.764 --> 00:42:35.865
One...

00:42:37.641 --> 00:42:38.691
Two...

00:42:41.354 --> 00:42:42.381
Three.

00:42:46.317 --> 00:42:47.511
I'm just kidding.

00:42:48.694 --> 00:42:50.481
Don't force yourself to recall it.

00:42:51.155 --> 00:42:52.336
It's better this way.

00:42:52.615 --> 00:42:55.659
You might avoid seeing me.

00:42:58.996 --> 00:43:00.289
Someone actually told me that

00:43:00.289 --> 00:43:02.575
when it comes to embarrassing things…

00:43:02.750 --> 00:43:07.797
It's better to pretend
as if nothing happened.

00:43:15.018 --> 00:43:16.071
Come.

00:43:16.389 --> 00:43:17.538
I'll put it on you.

00:43:35.408 --> 00:43:37.493
It adds to your beauty…

00:43:39.370 --> 00:43:43.290
When you wear expensive jewelry
made with silver and gold.

00:43:45.084 --> 00:43:49.380
But I'm aware you prefer gifts
made with one's own effort.

00:43:51.674 --> 00:43:54.009
That's why I thought of giving this to you.

00:44:01.927 --> 00:44:05.034
This was the other
necklace I ought to give you.

00:44:05.503 --> 00:44:08.964
I wanted to give it you at the pier.

00:44:10.484 --> 00:44:11.861
But you didn't come.

00:44:15.072 --> 00:44:16.269
I'm sorry.

00:44:16.296 --> 00:44:18.509
I failed to wake up early.

00:44:18.534 --> 00:44:19.936
That's why I couldn't come.

00:44:20.494 --> 00:44:24.165
If he only knew how much
I prepared for that day.

00:44:24.165 --> 00:44:26.375
But the things is, Helena
was going there first.

00:44:27.501 --> 00:44:28.878
I went there early.

00:44:29.712 --> 00:44:30.830
I waited for you.

00:44:32.360 --> 00:44:33.945
Speaking of Helena,

00:44:33.970 --> 00:44:37.515
she told me she's going to
respond to Juanito's proposal.

00:44:39.513 --> 00:44:41.640
What happened with you and Helena?

00:44:43.684 --> 00:44:45.941
I was already aboard
the ship when she arrived.

00:44:47.354 --> 00:44:49.356
I actually thought it was you who came.

00:44:52.109 --> 00:44:55.270
Even the letters I've sent
you were left unanswered.

00:44:55.906 --> 00:44:58.701
So, Helena wasn't able
to tell Juanito her feelings?

00:45:01.994 --> 00:45:03.329
Yeah, actually…

00:45:04.218 --> 00:45:05.761
it was Maria and Mother.

00:45:06.665 --> 00:45:07.958
We're always going out.

00:45:08.250 --> 00:45:10.294
I forgot to reply to your letters.

00:45:11.003 --> 00:45:12.030
I'm sorry.

00:45:17.718 --> 00:45:19.762
You forgot to wake up early…

00:45:22.293 --> 00:45:24.211
You also forgot to reply to my letters.

00:45:27.191 --> 00:45:29.652
You don't remember
anything from last night.

00:45:32.407 --> 00:45:33.864
What else did you forgot?

00:45:44.495 --> 00:45:45.504
I promise…

00:45:47.748 --> 00:45:49.291
I won't ever forget anymore.

00:45:52.044 --> 00:45:53.475
I hope you won't forget…

00:45:55.381 --> 00:45:56.850
That no matter what happens…

00:45:58.458 --> 00:45:59.753
And where ever I may be…

00:46:01.887 --> 00:46:02.948
I'll wait for you.

00:46:25.319 --> 00:46:26.779
Oh no!

00:46:27.451 --> 00:46:29.286
I can't fall in love
with Juanito!

00:46:29.311 --> 00:46:30.729
Miss, what are you
doing here?

00:46:31.500 --> 00:46:33.377
What is it to you
if I want to get drunk?!

00:46:33.377 --> 00:46:34.962
I don't even care!

00:46:39.133 --> 00:46:40.301
Miss Carmelita, let's go.

00:46:40.687 --> 00:46:41.938
Her name's Cristeta.

00:46:42.329 --> 00:46:44.466
A man wearing black came.

00:46:44.496 --> 00:46:46.414
He told me I was safe.

00:46:46.439 --> 00:46:47.600
But I have to say that

00:46:47.600 --> 00:46:49.402
Don Alejandro was
the mastermind.

00:46:52.057 --> 00:46:54.390
Don't you love
reading books?

00:46:54.570 --> 00:46:56.396
I am feeling dizzy.

00:46:56.805 --> 00:46:58.165
Do you know
that feeling...

00:46:58.268 --> 00:47:00.382
It feels like I can't read
for a few months.

00:47:00.631 --> 00:47:02.423
I am yours and you are mine.

00:47:02.600 --> 00:47:04.185
That is what's written
in the stars.

00:47:07.877 --> 00:47:09.453
Why are you two
alone in here?!

00:47:09.519 --> 00:47:11.981
- We're not doing anything wrong!
- You're misunderstanding this.

00:47:12.458 --> 00:47:15.836
Did Juanito gave you
a letter for me?

00:47:15.978 --> 00:47:19.773
He stopped sending me letters since he
came back to Manila.

00:47:19.798 --> 00:47:21.008
Mr. Leandro.